          "planning_summary": "This review offers a structured framework for understanding how gut microbiota and metabolites modulate ICI efficacy and toxicity in solid tumors. It provides detailed mechanistic insights into specific taxa (e.g., Bacteroides, Bifidobacterium, Akkermansia) and metabolites (SCFAs, indoles, TMAO), along with an evaluation of clinical interventions like FMT and probiotics. It is particularly useful for mapping mechanistic pathways and identifying context-dependent biomarkers, while cautioning against universal generalizations due to cohort and methodological heterogeneity.",
          "scope_interpretation_cautions": [
